WEBVTT

00:00:29.025 --> 00:00:33.946
were living without access
to basic facilities

00:00:33.946 --> 00:00:36.741
such as water and electricity.

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:43.247
The community was bussing water
two hours from Karachi.

00:00:44.207 --> 00:00:47.627
This made their water so expensive

00:00:47.627 --> 00:00:53.049
that their livestock went
without water every other day.

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:59.764
Bathing and laundry was a luxury.